WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Lie on your back, knees bent, feet flat near the hips.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Place the hands by the ears, fingers toward the shoulders.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Press into hands and feet to lift the hips and crown off the floor.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Straighten the arms, opening the chest. Lower with control.
